===Noun===
{{en-noun|hearties}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete|or|jocular|_|nautical}} a term of familiar address and fellowship among sailors.
#* {{quote-text|year=1849|author={{w|Herman Melville}}|title=[[s:Redburn. His First Voyage|Redburn. His First Voyage]]|chapter=VI|passage=“Ay, ay,” muttered the chief mate, as they rolled out of then-boats and swaggered on deck, “it’s your turn now, but it will be mine before long. Yaw about while you may, my '''hearties''', I’ll do the yawing after the anchor’s up.”}}

